  "details": "I have noticed that, when using the Quest hand tracking, you can't open the menu that allows you to turn toggles, do emotes, and such. This could easily be implemented, since there are many finger shortcuts which aren't used (For example, right index with right thumb, pinkies with thumb, etc.). It feels more like an oversight than anything, since it makes it so that you can't fully play the game without the use of controllers.",
